 "items": [
  {
   "kind": "flashcard",
   "word": "Verbes avec être",
   "type": "Rule",
   "translation": "Verbs of movement and change of state use être: aller, venir, arriver, partir, entrer, sortir, monter, descendre, rester, tomber, naître, mourir, devenir, retourner",
